<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets 5.0 bln skr 1-yr T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets 5.0 bln skr 1-yr T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of five billion crowns worth of one-year Treasury bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on October 9, and bids are due at 1030 GMT on that date. The settlement date is October 11.</p>
<p> Maturity date		Issue volume	    Number of days</p>
<p> October 15, 1997	   5.0 bln skr		 364</p>
